^warning: ignoring
--
Itanium C++ ABI 2.4 II.1: vptr at offset 0 of a dynamic class whose bases
are not dynamic; base subobject offsets computed from the layout (not assumed
0 for the first base).  Classes with dynamic bases (shared vptr) and virtual
bases are still modelled differently (see the notes).
The expected sizes and offsets are those of the LP64 x86_64 data model
(`--64'); the test is not meaningful in a 32-bit configuration.
